{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium Shopify product information section for a supplement ecommerce website inspired by modern fitness brands.
    
    SECTION LAYOUT:
    
    Build a fully responsive product information section with:
    
    1. Top horizontal feature bar
    2. Dynamic tab navigation
    3. Left content area
    4. Right nutrition facts table
    
    Desktop:
    - 2-column layout
    - Left content wider
    - Right nutrition table sticky or aligned neatly
    - Spacious modern layout
    
    Mobile:
    - Stack vertically
    - Scrollable tabs horizontally
    - Optimized spacing and typography
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    TOP FEATURE BAR
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Create a top horizontal feature strip with 4 feature items.
    
    Each feature item should include:
    - Custom icon picker
    - Title
    - Subtitle
    
    Examples:
    - Premium Quality
    - Science Backed
    - Fast Delivery
    - Secure Payments
    
    IMPORTANT:
    Merchant must be able to:
    - Add/remove feature items
    - Change icon
    - Change title/subtitle
    - Reorder items
    - Change icon colors
    - Change background color
    
    Use Shopify blocks for these items.
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    DYNAMIC TAB SYSTEM
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Create fully dynamic product tabs.
    
    Default example tabs:
    - Description
    - Nutrition Facts
    - Ingredients
    - How To Use
    - Reviews
    
    IMPORTANT:
    Tabs must be:
    - Dynamic
    - Add/remove/reorder enabled
    - Connected with Shopify metafields
    - Editable from theme customizer
    
    Each tab content should support:
    - Rich text
    - Bullet points
    - Images
    - Icons
    - HTML
    - Metafields
    
    Use smooth active tab switching animation.
    
    Active tab style:
    - Dark blue text
    - Orange underline
    - Modern clean look
    
    Inactive tabs:
    - Light gray text
    - Hover transition
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    LEFT CONTENT AREA
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    This area should dynamically display tab content.
    
    For Description tab:
    - Rich text support
    - Bullet list support
    - Icons beside bullet points
    - Heading support
    
    For How To Use tab:
    - Multiple instruction cards
    - Custom icon picker
    - Heading
    - Description
    
    Merchant should be able to:
    - Add/remove cards
    - Change icons
    - Reorder cards
    - Customize text
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    RIGHT NUTRITION TABLE
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Create a premium nutrition facts table.
    
    IMPORTANT:
    Table must be FULLY DYNAMIC.
    
    Merchant should be able to:
    - Add/remove rows
    - Reorder rows
    - Highlight specific rows
    - Change row label
    - Change row value
    - Change text alignment
    - Add bold rows
    - Add divider rows
    - Change table title
    - Change serving size text
    
    Example rows:
    - Energy
    - Protein
    - Carbohydrates
    - Sugars
    - Fats
    - BCAAs
    - Glutamine
    
    Highlighted rows should:
    - Have slightly darker background
    - Bold text
    - Optional accent border
    
    Use Shopify blocks for rows.
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    SHOPIFY METAFIELDS
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Connect all major content with Shopify metafields.
    
    Required metafields:
    - custom.description
    - custom.ingredients
    - custom.how_to_use
    - custom.nutrition_facts
    - custom.reviews_text
    
    Nutrition facts should support:
    - JSON metafield
    OR
    - Repeater/block structure
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    DESIGN STYLE
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Style should feel:
    - Premium
    - Clean
    - Scientific
    - Fitness supplement focused
    
    Colors:
    - Primary Blue: #0B2C6B
    - Accent Orange: #FF6A00
    - Light Gray Background: #F5F7FA
    
    UI Requirements:
    - Rounded corners
    - Soft shadows
    - Thin borders
    - Smooth hover effects
    - Modern typography
    - Plenty of whitespace
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Build using:
    - Shopify Liquid
    - CSS
    - Minimal JavaScript
    
    Requirements:
    - Dawn theme compatible
    - Fully responsive
    - Semantic HTML
    - Optimized performance
    - No unnecessary libraries
    - Reusable Shopify section
    - Schema settings included
    - Dynamic blocks for all repeatable items
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    ADVANCED CUSTOMIZATION
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Merchant customization options:
    - Change section spacing
    - Change colors
    - Change typography
    - Enable/disable table
    - Enable/disable feature strip
    - Enable/disable tabs
    - Change icon size
    - Change border radius
    - Change active tab style
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    USER EXPERIENCE
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Add:
    - Smooth tab transitions
    - Hover effects
    - Mobile swipeable tabs
    - Clean responsive table
    - Accessible keyboard navigation
    
    Overall design should look like a high-end supplement brand product page optimized for conversions and trust building., in the tabs where we have description ingredients etc there is a visible scroll bar we need to hide visibility
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-product-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_spacing }}px 0;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_bg_color }};
  }

  .ai-product-info-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.container_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-feature-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    padding: 30px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.feature_bar_bg }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  .ai-feature-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 15px;
  }

  .ai-feature-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: {{ block.settings.feature_icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.feature_icon_size }}px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: {{ block.settings.feature_icon_color }};
  }

  .ai-feature-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .ai-feature-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ai-feature-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.feature_title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }

  .ai-feature-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: {{ block.settings.feature_subtitle_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-tabs-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid {{ block.settings.tab_border_color }};
    overflow-x: auto;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
  }

  .ai-tabs-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-tabs-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 40px;
    min-width: min-content;
  }

  .ai-tab-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    padding: 15px 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: {{ block.settings.tab_inactive_color }};
    cursor: pointer;
    position: relative;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-tab-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    color: {{ block.settings.tab_active_color }};
  }

  .ai-tab-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    color: {{ block.settings.tab_active_color }};
  }

  .ai-tab-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -1px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 3px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.tab_active_underline }};
    border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0;
  }

  .ai-content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    .ai-content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: {% if block.settings.show_nutrition_table %}2fr 1fr{% else %}1fr{% endif %};
    }
  }

  .ai-tab-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-tab-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-content-area-{{ ai_gen_id }} h3 {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.content_heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-content-area-{{ ai_gen_id }} p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.content_text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 15px;
  }

  .ai-content-area-{{ ai_gen_id }} ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-content-area-{{ ai_gen_id }} li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.content_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-content-area-{{ ai_gen_id }} li::before {
    content: '✓';
    color: {{ block.settings.tab_active_underline }};
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-instruction-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .ai-instruction-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 15px;
    padding: 20px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_bg_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
  }

  .ai-instruction-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: {{ block.settings.instruction_icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.instruction_icon_size }}px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: {{ block.settings.instruction_icon_color }};
  }

  .ai-instruction-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .ai-instruction-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} h4 {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.content_heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .ai-instruction-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: {{ block.settings.content_text_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-nutrition-table-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.table_bg_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    padding: 25px;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.table_border_color }};
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    .ai-nutrition-table-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      position: sticky;
      top: 20px;
    }
  }

  .ai-table-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.table_title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .ai-table-serving-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: {{ block.settings.table_text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid {{ block.settings.table_border_color }};
  }

  .ai-table-rows-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .ai-table-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid {{ block.settings.table_border_color }};
  }

  .ai-table-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}.highlighted {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.table_highlight_bg }};
    padding: 12px 15px;
    margin: 0 -15px;
    border-left: 3px solid {{ block.settings.tab_active_underline }};
  }

  .ai-table-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}.bold {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ai-table-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.table_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-table-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.table_value_color }};
  }

  @media (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-feature-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 15px;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .ai-tabs-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-left: -20px;
      margin-right: -20px;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .ai-tabs-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .ai-tab-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .ai-content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .ai-nutrition-table-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 20px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<product-info-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-product-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-product-info-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.show_feature_bar %}
      <div class="ai-feature-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% for i in (1..4) %}
          {% assign feature_icon_key = 'feature_' | append: i | append: '_icon' %}
          {% assign feature_title_key = 'feature_' | append: i | append: '_title' %}
          {% assign feature_subtitle_key = 'feature_' | append: i | append: '_subtitle' %}
          
          {% if block.settings[feature_title_key] != blank %}
            <div class="ai-feature-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if block.settings[feature_icon_key] != blank %}
                <div class="ai-feature-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings[feature_icon_key] }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
              <div class="ai-feature-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-feature-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings[feature_title_key] }}</div>
                {% if block.settings[feature_subtitle_key] != blank %}
                  <div class="ai-feature-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings[feature_subtitle_key] }}</div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-tabs-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-tabs-{{ ai_gen_id }}" role="tablist">
        {% for i in (1..5) %}
          {% assign tab_title_key = 'tab_' | append: i | append: '_title' %}
          {% if block.settings[tab_title_key] != blank %}
            <button
              class="ai-tab-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if forloop.first %}active{% endif %}"
              role="tab"
              aria-selected="{% if forloop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
              data-tab-id="tab-{{ i }}"
            >
              {{ block.settings[tab_title_key] }}
            </button>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-content-area-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% for i in (1..5) %}
          {% assign tab_title_key = 'tab_' | append: i | append: '_title' %}
          {% assign tab_content_key = 'tab_' | append: i | append: '_content' %}
          {% assign tab_metafield_key = 'tab_' | append: i | append: '_metafield' %}
          
          {% if block.settings[tab_title_key] != blank %}
            <div
              class="ai-tab-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if forloop.first %}active{% endif %}"
              id="tab-{{ i }}"
              role="tabpanel"
            >
              {% if block.settings[tab_metafield_key] != blank %}
                {% assign metafield_parts = block.settings[tab_metafield_key] | split: '.' %}
                {% if metafield_parts.size == 2 %}
                  {{ product.metafields[metafield_parts[0]][metafield_parts[1]] }}
                {% endif %}
              {% elsif block.settings[tab_content_key] != blank %}
                {{ block.settings[tab_content_key] }}
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      {% if block.settings.show_nutrition_table %}
        <div class="ai-nutrition-table-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.table_title != blank %}
            <h3 class="ai-table-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.table_title }}</h3>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.serving_size != blank %}
            <div class="ai-table-serving-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.serving_size }}</div>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="ai-table-rows-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% for i in (1..15) %}
              {% assign row_label_key = 'nutrition_' | append: i | append: '_label' %}
              {% assign row_value_key = 'nutrition_' | append: i | append: '_value' %}
              {% assign row_highlight_key = 'nutrition_' | append: i | append: '_highlight' %}
              {% assign row_bold_key = 'nutrition_' | append: i | append: '_bold' %}
              
              {% if block.settings[row_label_key] != blank %}
                <div class="ai-table-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if block.settings[row_highlight_key] %}highlighted{% endif %} {% if block.settings[row_bold_key] %}bold{% endif %}">
                  <span class="ai-table-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings[row_label_key] }}</span>
                  <span class="ai-table-value-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings[row_value_key] }}</span>
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</product-info-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class ProductInfoSection{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.tabButtons = this.querySelectorAll('.ai-tab-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.tabContents = this.querySelectorAll('.ai-tab-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.setupTabs();
      }

      setupTabs() {
        this.tabButtons.forEach((button) => {
          button.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const tabId = button.getAttribute('data-tab-id');
            this.switchTab(tabId, button);
          });
        });
      }

      switchTab(tabId, clickedButton) {
        this.tabButtons.forEach((btn) => {
          btn.classList.remove('active');
          btn.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'false');
        });

        this.tabContents.forEach((content) => {
          content.classList.remove('active');
        });

        clickedButton.classList.add('active');
        clickedButton.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'true');

        const targetContent = this.querySelector('#' + tabId);
        if (targetContent) {
          targetContent.classList.add('active');
        }
      }
    }

    customElements.define('product-info-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}', ProductInfoSection{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

